Shebeke: Digital Glass

Copyright (c) 2026, project author.

This repository contains an original interactive digital-art implementation
of a shebeke-inspired visual system, including its HTML, CSS, JavaScript,
WebGL shaders, SVG pattern, documentation, and project configuration.

